  "id": "distributed-practice",
  "term": "distributed practice",
  "definition": "Distributed practice is a learning approach in which the same amount of study or practice time is spread across multiple sessions instead of being completed in one session. Research described in the packet indicates it tends to support stronger long-term performance than massed practice.",
